      "id": 1350312,
      "name": "[Claret] Crimson-Eyed Bat Shadow",
      "desc": "When Claret's ATK exceeds 1,500, every point of ATK above the threshold increases her DEF by 1.3 points. This effect from different armaments cannot stack. Claret's Gash Buildup Rate is reduced by 10%. <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Bloodbloom Oath - Starforging</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Bloodbloom Oath - Subduing Axe</color> deal <color=#2BAD00>40% bonus Sharp DMG</color>. Triggering Perfect Dodge while in the Crimson Inscription state extends the duration of Crimson Inscription by 3s (can only be triggered once per 5s).",
